t-1% | ₹ 21570 / sq.ft-5% |\n| Chincholi Bunder Road | ₹ 23125 / sq.ft5% | ₹ 22062 / sq.ft-1% | ₹ 22343 / sq.ft1% | ₹ 22069 / sq.ft-2% |\n| Malad | ₹ 22014 / sq.ft1% | ₹ 21898 / sq.ft4% | ₹ 21117 / sq.ft1% | ₹ 21064 / sq.ft-3% |\n| Chembur | ₹ 24654 / sq.ft2% | ₹ 24165 / sq.ft1% | ₹ 23976 / sq.ft1% | ₹ 23734 / sq.ft-1% |\n\n## Satyam Shivam CHS Photos & Videos\n\n![Satyam Shivam CHS photos 1](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Satyam Shivam CHS photos 1\")\n![Satyam Shivam CHS photos 2](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Satyam Shivam CHS photos 2\")\n![Satyam Shivam CHS photos 3](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Satyam Shivam CHS photos 3\")\n![Satyam Shivam CHS photos 4](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Satyam Shivam CHS photos 4\")\n![Satyam Shivam CHS photos 5](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Satyam Shivam CHS photos 5\")\n![Satyam Shivam CHS photos 6](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Satyam Shivam CHS photos 6\")\n![Satyam Shivam CHS photos 7](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Satyam Shivam CHS photos 7\")\n![Satyam Shivam CHS photos 8](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Satyam Shivam CHS photos 8\")\n![Satyam Shivam CHS photos 9](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Satyam Shivam CHS photos 9\")\n\n## About [Malad West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Malad-West-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\n![Malad West Video](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Malad West Video\")\n\n## About Parikh Group\n\n![](https://cdn.staticmb.com/pdpstatic/images/no-image-builder.svg)\n\n|  |\n| --- |\n| We take the pleasure in introducing ourselves as one of the reputed Builders and Developers in the said vicinity. Our group is engaged in Construction activities at Mumbai and also undertakes turnkey civil contracts for various buildings. Various concerns of our group have been dealing with your bank and have also been granted diverse credit facilities by the bank from time to time. The group has been engaged in the above activities for last 25 years and has handled over 40 construction projects of different sizes & values, (Singly as well as in joint venture) on our own account and as civil contractors. Parikh Group has been promoted by three brothers; Shri Pankaj S. Parikh, Shri Vinod S. Parikh and Shri Chetan S. Parikh. All the three brothers have been involved in the real estates construction and development business since last more then two decades and are respected names in the builder's fraternity in Mumbai. Shri Vinod Parikh himself is a qualified Civil Engineer. The group started the construction activities by undertaking construction projects in joint ventures with other large construction houses. Slowly the Group started their own ventures also and till date has undertaken many residential and commercial projects, all of which have been greatly appreciated by the buying public and earned the group a respectability for adhering to time schedules and premium quality construction. It is a matter of great pride for the group that its projects always fetch a premium over the prevailing market price in the locality of the project. The Parikh Group has completed construction work in and around Malad, Virar, and Powai so far. In the entire group has handled about 100 cores worth of projects so far. In Malad, the group has completed prestigious project like Jas Villa, Pleasant Park, Nandalaya, Vikas Park, Vikas Chambers, Satyam Shivam, Bharat Apt., Prestige Industrial Estate etc. The group added another feather in its cap by successfully completed Mega Residential Complex like Shantivan Complex, Premium Park, Pleasant Park, Prabhat Complex & Paradise Park in Virar. The group has now set its sight in and around Virar for many future projects as Virar is fast developing into a friendly location for low cost and high quality residential localities because of many infrastructural developments in the area. Details for the said project is as per attached list. |\n\nWe take the pleasure in introducing ourselves as one of the reputed Builders and Developers in the said vicinity. Our group is engaged in Construction activities at Mumbai and also undertakes turnkey civil contracts for various buildings. Various concerns of our group have been dealing with your bank and have also been granted diverse credit facilities by the bank from time to time. The group has been engaged in the above activities for last 25 years and has handled over 40 construction projects of different sizes & values, (Singly as well as in joint venture) on our own account and as civil contractors.  \nParikh Group has been promoted by three brothers; Shri Pankaj S. Parikh, Shri Vinod S. Parikh and Shri Chetan S. Parikh. All the three brothers have been involved in the real estates construction and development business since last more then two decades and are respected names in the builder's fraternity in Mumbai. Shri Vinod Parikh himself is a qualified Civil Engineer.  \nThe group started the construction activities by undertaking construction projects in joint ventures with other large construction houses. Slowly the Group started their own ventures also and till date has undertaken many residential and commercial projects, all of which have been greatly appreciated by the buying public and earned the group a respectability for adhering to time schedules and premium quality construction. It is a matter of great pride for the group that its projects always fetch a premium over the prevailing market price in the locality of the project.  \nThe Parikh Group has completed construction work in and around Malad, Virar, and Powai so far. In the entire group has handled about 100 cores worth of projects so far. In Malad, the group has completed prestigious project like Jas Villa, Pleasant Park, Nandalaya, Vikas Park, Vikas Chambers, Satyam Shivam, Bharat Apt., Prestige Industrial Estate etc. The group added another feather in its cap by successfully completed Mega Residential Complex like Shantivan Complex, Premium Park, Pleasant Park, Prabhat Complex & Paradise Park in Virar. The group has now set its sight in and around Virar for many future projects as Virar is fast developing into a friendly location for low cost and high quality residential localities because of many infrastructural developments in the area. Details for the said project is as per attached list.\n\n![Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner\")\n![](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n![Sheth Irene photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Sheth Irene photo\")\n![AJMERA BOULEVARD photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"AJMERA BOULEVARD photo\")\n![Pranav Sparsh photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Pranav Sparsh photo\")\n![Yukti Anchorpoint Aviara photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Yukti Anchorpoint Aviara photo\")\n![Gurukrupa Marina Enclave Wings Q and R with Kindergarten photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Gurukrupa Marina Enclave Wings Q and R with Kindergarten photo\")\n![Shreeji Eternity photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Eternity photo\")\n![Abrol Signature photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Abrol Signature photo\")\n![Chandak Treesourus photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Chandak Treesourus photo\")\n![Sheth Auris Ilaria photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Sheth Auris Ilaria photo\")\n![Lotus Sky Garden photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Lotus Sky Garden photo\")\n\n## Other Projects by Parikh Group\n\n![Parikh Platinum Park Avenue D2 photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Parikh Platinum Park Avenue D2 photo\")\n![Paradise Park photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Paradise Park photo\")\n![Parikh Yash Platina photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Parikh Yash Platina photo\")\n![Parikh Peninsula Residency photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Parikh Peninsula Residency photo\")\n![Peninsula Heights photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Peninsula Heights photo\")\n![Parikh Paradise Residency photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Parikh Paradise Residency photo\")\n![No image available](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"No image available\")\n![Pearl Apartment ph